{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 10, "data": [{"docid2": 1734528, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共文化场馆", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202112/t20211206_1734528.htm", "content": "　　三明市图书馆创办于1958年，原址位于三明市三元区中山路228号的旧文庙，1979年搬至三明市三元区三元街1号，1991年迁入三明市梅列区（现为三元区）高岩新村7幢，2015年搬至三明市梅列区（现为三元区）双园新村50幢", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202112/t20211206_1734528.htm", "docreltime": "2026.06.30 17:19:00", "doctitle": "三明市图书馆", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1850273, "sourcename": "三明市文化和旅游局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202112/t20211206_1734528.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202112/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2110275, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共文化场馆", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202503/t20250328_2110275.htm", "content": "\n　　三明市艺术馆是政府设立的专门从事群众文化艺术工作的事业机构，隶属于三明市文化广电新闻出版局。是组织与指导群众文化活动、培训群众文化在职干部和业余文艺骨干、研究群众文化艺术、搜集、整理、开发、研究民", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202503/t20250328_2110275.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.28 09:19:00", "doctitle": "三明市艺术馆", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2304818, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202503/t20250328_2110275.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1852189, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共文化场馆", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202211/t20221129_1852189.htm", "content": "\n　　三明市客家文化艺术中心（三明市歌舞剧院）成立于1986年，位于三明市三元区东新六路体育场西区一层，是我市唯一一家综合性、高水准的国有歌舞艺术院团。三明市客家文化艺术中心（三明市歌舞剧院）以保护、传承客", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202211/t20221129_1852189.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.01 15:09:00", "doctitle": "三明市客家文化艺术中心", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1989423, "sourcename": "三明市文化和旅游局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202211/t20221129_1852189.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202211/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1748402, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共文化场馆", "chnldocurl": "https://www.ivrpano.com/p/3d386b459d92e15d?_s=f6627ae48093e7d9", "content": "", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.ivrpano.com/p/3d386b459d92e15d?_s=f6627ae48093e7d9", "docreltime": "2022.01.11 10:44:00", "doctitle": "三明市博物馆(实景)", "doctype": 30, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1866585, "sourcename": "三明市博物馆", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 30, "url": "https://www.ivrpano.com/p/3d386b459d92e15d?_s=f6627ae48093e7d9", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1734534, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共文化场馆", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202112/t20211206_1734534.htm", "content": "\n　　三明书画院成立于1983年，2011年加挂三明市美术馆，1987年有专门编制。1998年，坐落在三明市绿化中心广场边、占地3.5亩、总面积3400平方米、六层建筑的书画院大楼落成，内辟展厅（二楼、三楼各一个）、陈列厅、", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202112/t20211206_1734534.htm", "docreltime": "2021.12.06 17:27:00", "doctitle": "三明市书画院（三明市美术馆）", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1850279, "sourcename": "三明市文化和旅游局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202112/t20211206_1734534.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202112/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1734529, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共文化场馆", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202112/t20211206_1734529.htm", "content": "\n　　三明市少儿图书馆是国家二级公共图书馆，创建于1992年1月，承担着知识导航、阅读引领、社会教育、文明传承等职能。\n　　三明市少儿图书馆位于三明市三元区三元街１号，现有馆舍面积1500平方米，共有阅览座席327", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202112/t20211206_1734529.htm", "docreltime": "2021.12.06 17:25:00", "doctitle": "三明市少儿图书馆", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1850274, "sourcename": "三明市文化和旅游局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202112/t20211206_1734529.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202112/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1732292, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共文化场馆", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202111/t20211129_1732292.htm", "content": "\n　　序号\n　　名称\n　　地址\n　　等级\n　　馆舍面积\n　　1\n　　三明市艺术馆\n　　三明市三元区双园新村50幢B座\n　　国家一级文化馆    \n　　8100平方米（其中文化馆6000平方米，非遗博览苑2100。）\n　　2\n　　三明市", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202111/t20211129_1732292.htm", "docreltime": "2021.11.29 18:48:00", "doctitle": "三明市各县（市、区）文化馆基本情况一览表(2021年）", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1847509, "sourcename": "三明市文化和旅游局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202111/t20211129_1732292.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202111/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1732089, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共文化场馆", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202111/t20211129_1732089.htm", "content": "\n　　序号\n　　单位名称\n　　详细地址\n　　部颁级别\n　　馆舍面积（㎡）\n　　1\n　　三明市图书馆\n　　三元区双园新村50幢B座\n　　一级\n　　10000\n　　2\n　　三明市少儿图书馆\n　　三元区三元街1号\n　　二级\n　　1224", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202111/t20211129_1732089.htm", "docreltime": "2021.11.29 11:33:00", "doctitle": "三明地区公共图书馆基本情况一览表（2021年）", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1847288, "sourcename": "三明市文化和旅游局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202111/t20211129_1732089.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202111/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1729729, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共文化场馆", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202111/t20211123_1729729.htm", "content": "\n　　日前，省政府公布第九批省级文物保护单位名单及保护范围，经省文物管理委员会全体成员会议审议通过，共有岩仔洞遗址等252处（含7处合并保护单位）入列，这是新中国成立以来我省公布省级文物保护单位数量最多的一", "docabstract": "三明新增41处第九批省级文物保护单位", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202111/t20211123_1729729.htm", "docreltime": "2018.12.04 17:26:00", "doctitle": "三明新增41处第九批省级文物保护单位", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1843863, "sourcename": "市文化广电新闻出版局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202111/t20211123_1729729.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202111/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1729728, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "公共文化场馆", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/gysy/ggwhcg/202111/t20211123_1729728.